{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fff00944-c8d4-84d9-81f3-0f6cd23bd2b2",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T11:21:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, Denise, this is Linda Tillinghast. I'm calling about water coming out of a pipe at the curb, you know, on my street, and it's turning the sidewalk into a skating rink."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:17:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:17:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 256 Marsh Street, down the Point. Right in front of my house, basically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:17:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 256 Marsh. And the water's coming out of a pipe at the curb? Is it a storm drain, or something that looks like a drainpipe in the curb face?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I mean, it's a pipe, right, sticking out low at the curb, and water just runs out of it. All day, all night. And it's not even raining. We haven't had a storm in, what, a while. It's dry. So where's it coming from, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:17:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so no rain or snowmelt involved, just a steady flow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:17:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Steady, yeah. And it's freezing, because, I mean, it's February. So it runs across the sidewalk and turns into this sheet of ice. Solid. I almost went down yesterday, and I'm not exactly twenty-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. Is it just the sidewalk or is it reaching the road too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It gets into the street a bit, and cars are slowing way down going through it, like a crawl, you know? People are tapping the brakes, and there's a bend there. Somebody's going to slide into somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I can see why that worries you. Let me pull up that location and see what we have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm looking at Marsh Street. Are you the homeowner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am, yes. Homeowner. Been there a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:18:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm not seeing anything open on that block right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so that's what I wanted to ask, actually. When did they last come by? Like, has anybody looked at this pipe, or the drain, or whatever it is? Because it feels like nobody's been there in forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see an older entry for catch basin cleaning in that area, but nothing about that outfall or a leak. I'd rather not tell you a date that I can't back up from this screen. I can have the crew supervisor check the maintenance log."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I mean, that's fair. I just want somebody to look at it, you know? Because if it's a water main or something, that's different from a drain, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. If it's a water line, that goes to the water division, and if it's groundwater or a drain, it's us. So I'll put it in as a continuous dry-weather flow with ice on the sidewalk and the road, and flag it as a safety hazard. They can sort out whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. That makes sense. Honestly I'd love to be out there, because in the summer, I keep bees, so I'm usually out in the yard and, you know, I'm already dreaming of honey. Instead I'm out here with a bucket of salt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, salt on the sidewalk is a good idea for now. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, right. And is that going to be today? Because it's Friday, and it's going to freeze up again tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's going to the top of the list for this afternoon since it's a hazard, but a crew has to see it first. If it gets worse before then, call us back and we'll note it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, thank you, Denise. I appreciate you taking it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:21:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Linda. Stay off that ice. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye now."
    }
  ],
